@startuml
scale max 2800 width
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam shadowing false

title Activity Diagram WF-03 - Grounded AI Historical Roleplay Chat & Daily Token Boost Workflow

|Student / Customer|
start
:Select HistoricalContext & Character on Timeline/Map;
:Initialize or resume ChatSession;
:Send historical question to Character;

|Core Backend & AI Service|
:Perform lazy daily token reset if new day;
if (Available Daily / Tier Tokens >= Required?) then (Yes)
    :Embed query via BGE-M3 & retrieve Top-10 chunks\nfrom Supabase PgVector;
    :Rerank chunks via Kaggle Cross-Encoder\n(or fallback to Top-2 cosine chunks);
    :Stream 1st-person grounded response +\n3 suggested follow-up questions;
    :Persist User & AI Messages, deduct tokens,\nand update active AI_CHAT_ROLEPLAY assignment;
    |Student / Customer|
    :Read streamed response & continue dialogue;
    stop
else (No - Daily Quota Reached)
    |Student / Customer|
    :Receive Quota Exceeded alert;
    :Submit TokenBoostRequest (requestedTokens, reason);
endif

|Teacher / School Admin|
:Review pending TokenBoostRequest in Classroom/School console;
if (Approve Boost Request?) then (Approve)
    :Verify school unallocatedTokenQuota >= approvedTokens;
    :Update TokenBoostRequest (status = APPROVED);
    :Credit approvedTokens to student dailyBonusTokens;
    |Student / Customer|
    :Resume AI Character Roleplay conversation immediately;
else (Reject)
    |Teacher / School Admin|
    :Update TokenBoostRequest (status = REJECTED, reviewNote);
endif
stop
@enduml
